# Click-a-thon 2026 · Atlys AgentHouse

Hackathon: build an **agentic analytics system on ClickHouse** that turns a feature spec into schemas, insights, and an up-to-date business context layer — all **Langfuse-traced**.

## Canonical docs (read before inventing)

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `problem_statement.md` | Challenge, deliverables, judging |
| `readme_start_here.md` | Package map + load steps |
| `base_context.md` | Business entities, metrics, known issues (intentionally imperfect) |
